### Variables globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = 

### Test de conexión
GET {{baseUrl}}/test
Content-Type: application/json

### Registro de usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Juan",
    "apellido": "Pérez",
    "email": "juan@example.com",
    "password": "123456",
    "telefono": "1234567890"
}

### Login de usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "juan@example.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Ejemplo de ruta protegida (guardar el token de la respuesta de login en @authToken)
GET {{baseUrl}}/protected-route
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json